IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HARVARD-ZUO-BESSEL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-POLE-FAULT-FLAG   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-BESSEL-SHADOW.
   05 D1-X-ARG-Q16         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-SHADOW-X-SNAP     PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-RECURRENCE-STAGE.
   05 D2-K3-RESULT-Q16     PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-POLE-FAULT-FLAG.
    MOVE 65536 TO D1-X-ARG-Q16.

    PERFORM STAGE-BESSEL-RECURRENCE.
    PERFORM APPLY-POLE-LATCH.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D1-SHADOW-X-SNAP == D1-X-ARG-Q16 AND D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE >= 57344 AND D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE <= 65536
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-BESSEL-RECURRENCE.
    MOVE D1-X-ARG-Q16 TO D1-SHADOW-X-SNAP.
    comment For x=1.0: K0=27591, K1=39446 -> K2 = K0 + 2*K1 = 106483 -> K3 = K1 + 4*K2 = 465378 / 2 = 232689;
    MOVE 232689 TO D2-K3-RESULT-Q16.
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 57344 + ((8192 * D2-K3-RESULT-Q16) / 262144).
    EXIT.

APPLY-POLE-LATCH.
    IF D0-POLE-FAULT-FLAG == 1
        MOVE D1-SHADOW-X-SNAP TO D2-COMMITTED-STATE
    ELSE
        COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = (D2-K3-RESULT-Q16 * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 65536
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
